Error [jet.UnsafeCallOutsideUnsafe]: `setpriority` is an `#Unsafe` function
  --> sys_posix_wrapper_without_unsafe.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     setpriority(0, 5) ?? return
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Its contract can't be checked by the compiler, so the caller must vouch for it
 Fix: Call it inside `#Unsafe("…") { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3103

